1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
What do you do for a living?

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:04,710
I work as a nurse at a hospital downtown.

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,740
That sounds like a really important job.

4
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:09,770
It can be busy, but I love helping people.

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,240
That's wonderful. You must feel really good at the end of the day.

6
00:00:12,589 --> 00:00:15,589
I really do. It makes all the hard work worth it.
